  "title": "Passover Mushroom Dressing",
  "description": "This Passover mushroom dressing recipe with matzo meal is so good. Brown it well for a crisp topping, or bake it at a lower temp for a moister version.",
  "authors": [
    "JBLEVY"
  ],
